/// FireWeaponUpdateModuleData::friend_newModuleData. The module itself is
/// created by FireWeaponUpdate::friend_newModuleInstance, which is not
/// documented here. Zero Hour: the module fires a weapon at its own
/// object's feet as fast as the weapon allows, configured by \c Weapon,
/// \c InitialDelay and \c ExclusiveWeaponDelay. None of those three names
/// is in the BFME 2 table.
