///   each such line adds an entry;
/// - booleans, false by default: \c HeroModeTrigger,
///   \c ChargingModeTrigger and \c AliveOnly.
///
/// The trigger names suggest that firing can be tied to a hero mode or to
/// charging; this page does not confirm how they are used.
